---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Legal"
  description="Terms of Service and usage policies for the terminal authentication platform."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-6 animate-fade-in-up">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/10 dark:bg-cyan-950/60 border border-cyan-500/30 font-mono text-xs text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 dark:bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>LEGAL &bull; POLICY</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-50 font-sans tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono">
        Last updated: July 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none font-sans text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">Last Updated: July 2026</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        By accessing and using this website (thijsraaijmakers.me) and its associated subdomains and tools, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you are prohibited from using the site and its services.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">2. Description of Service</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        This website serves as a professional portfolio and hosts personal engineering projects, including the FleetPort Car Hiker Tracker. The tools provided, including integrations with third-party APIs (such as the RDW Open Data API) and shift-logging automation, are provided for demonstration, logistical management, and portfolio purposes.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">3. User Accounts and Security</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Certain features of this website require account registration. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials, including your 6-digit OTP codes and passwords. You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information during the registration process and to update such information to keep it accurate.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">4. Acceptable Use</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        You agree not to use the website or its tools for any unlawful purpose or any purpose prohibited under this clause. You agree not to use the automated tracking systems, API integrations, or form submissions in a way that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair the site, or interfere with any other party's use of the site. Automated scraping, malicious brute-forcing of the authentication system, and unauthorized access to restricted administrative areas are strictly prohibited.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The website and its automated tools are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. While every effort is made to ensure the security and accuracy of the data (such as vehicle specifications retrieved via external APIs), no warranties, expressed or implied, are made regarding the reliability, accuracy, or availability of the service. 
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">6. Governing Law</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with the laws of The Netherlands, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">7. Contact</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact me via the email provided in the website footer.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-mono">
        Welcome to our platform. By accessing or using our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
